{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Mu Noto 是一款以「少即是多」為設計理念的極簡筆記應用，特別適合喜歡紙本書寫、厭惡複雜功能與數位焦慮的使用者。它去除工具列、標籤與雲端同步等干擾，讓記錄回歸專注，目前限時免費，原價 US $9.99。</p>\n\n<h2>回歸書寫本質</h2>\n<p>Mu Noto 提供純淨如白紙的書寫體驗，沒有工具列、標籤或雲端同步，也沒有 AI 干擾。應用採用柔和的護眼背景與模擬紙張的輸入感受，不需註冊帳號，筆記內容僅儲存在本機。它拒絕加入協作、範本或行事曆等複雜模組，以「零干擾記錄」為核心，靈感源自東方禪學的「空」，為追求純粹書寫體驗的使用者提供溫暖而專注的數位空間。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-949-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-950-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-951-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-952-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-953-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Mu Noto-Simplest Easy Notes</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-20T11:20:26.966215+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":330,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}